<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 319-5 IN 50 OVERS V BANGLADESH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 319-5 IN 50 OVERS V BANGLADESH.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan made 319-5 in their 50 overs against Bangladesh in the Asia Cup match at the R.Premadasa stadium on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
